
######## 08:59:23 supi: IOS(X2)の bgp suppress-inactive を、static で RIB-failure にした経路で。soft out → hard reset の順に効くか見る
show running-config | section router bgp
router bgp 65100
 bgp router-id 10.100.255.2
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 neighbor 10.100.255.1 remote-as 65100
 neighbor 10.100.255.1 update-source Loopback0
 neighbor 172.16.3.254 remote-as 65000
 !
 address-family ipv4
  bgp suppress-inactive
  network 203.0.113.0
  neighbor 10.100.255.1 activate
  neighbor 10.100.255.1 next-hop-self
  neighbor 172.16.3.254 activate
 exit-address-family
X2#
show ip bgp rib-failure
